                <h3 class="postingHeader">Job Description and Duties</h3>
                <p class="postingContent">
                    <span style="font-size: 12pt;">This&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">is an exciting opportunity to join our team at the California Department of Veterans Affairs (CalVet). We advocate with purpose and passion every day for our state’s veterans and their families and connect them to their earned benefits. We offer a range of services, from our network of award-winning veterans&#39; homes to our innovative home loans program. Additionally, we provide special statewide benefits and veteran outreach services.</span><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 8pt 0pt 6pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">CalVet provides our staff with a wide range of fulfilling and enriching growth opportunities in skilled trades, healthcare, administrative and professional fields, and beyond. We actively cultivate an inclusive atmosphere that embraces individuals from diverse backgrounds, cultures, and life journeys, empowering them to excel and flourish. We enthusiastically welcome your distinctive contributions to our organization and the meaningful work we undertake.<br /><br />This position is located in the Skilled Nursing Facility of the Veterans Home of California - Redding.<br /><br />Apply  </span><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">today to join our team! Visit our website at </span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.calvet.ca.gov%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7CTanya.Murrey%40CalVet.ca.gov%7Cfeda1adc21ee49f1ee8908dc85a27b63%7C5b77b8ed547d427cbeb158a7d93b1f81%7C0%7C0%7C638532180117394999%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=IBfbvC%2BqsHyN59SSfpWTG4WMWpOLO5vUUeO6BvaCRPw%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="text-decoration-line: none;"><span style="color: #0000ff; text-decoration-line: underline;">www.calvet.ca.gov</span></a></span><span style="color: #0000ff; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"> </span><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">to learn more about us.<br /><br />We  </span><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial;">especially encourage veterans to apply utilizing CalVet’s Veterans Hiring Preference (please refer to the Special Requirements section below) and the state’s </span><span style="font-family: Arial;"><a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.calcareers.ca.gov%2FCalHRPublic%2FLanding%2FVeterans.aspx&amp;data=05%7C02%7CTanya.Murrey%40CalVet.ca.gov%7C1d6205157afa40e0157408dc97ad0508%7C5b77b8ed547d427cbeb158a7d93b1f81%7C0%7C0%7C638552016640168803%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=Om6S5v0Yn0%2BET7kRZurhoyzJKVeUSan0GCidK%2FY8Wew%3D&amp;reserved=0" style="text-decoration-line: none;"><span style="color: #0000ff; text-decoration-line: underline;">Veterans Preference program</span></a></span><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial;">.<br /><br />Please  </span></span><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">note: You will need to take and pass an examination for Certified Nursing Assistant&nbsp;to establish list eligibility prior to job offer. Please</span></p><p style="text-align: left; margin: 0pt 8pt 0pt 6pt;"><span style="color: #333333; font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;">visit </span><span style="font-family: Arial; font-size: 12pt;"><a href="https://gcc02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.jobs.ca.gov%2FCalHRPublic%2FLanding%2FJobs%2FSteps.aspx&amp;data=05%7C02%7CTanya.Murrey%40CalVet.ca.gov%7Cfeda1adc21ee49f1ee8908dc85a27b63%7C5b77b8ed547d427cbeb158a7d93b1f81%7C0%7C0%7C638532180117400621%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDA